umbed to perennial illness , in this case , an asthma attack ."}, "D6S4": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0282-111de4af9a55:d05", "start": 433, "end": 501, "text": "The news made the headlines the next day , queues formed to pass his"}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Anglican priest", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0282-111de4af9a55:d00:c0", "ramdocs-0282-111de4af9a55:d01:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "professional basketball player", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0282-111de4af9a55:d02:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C2", "answer": "architect", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0282-111de4af9a55:d03:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C3", "answer": "Rector", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0282-111de4af9a55:d05:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "ramdocs-0282-111de4af9a55:d00", "card_id": "ramdocs-0282-111de4af9a55:d00:c0", "entity": "Richard Sheppard", "scope": "profession", "claim": "Richard Sheppard's profession is an Anglican priest.", "answer": "Anglican priest", "quote": "Dick Sheppard (priest) Hugh Richard Lawrie \"Dick\" Sheppard (2 September 1880 – 31 October 1937) was an English Anglican priest, Dean of Canterbury and Christian pacifist.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0282-111de4af9a55:d01", "card_id": "ramdocs-0282-111de4af9a55:d01:c0", "entity": "Richard Sheppard", "scope": "profession", "claim": "Richard Sheppard's profession is that of an Anglican priest.", "answer": "Anglican priest", "quote": "what sort of man this Anglican priest was who had convinced Huxley not only to take up pacifism but to recognize that it required a spiritual dimension to succeed .", "original_document_number": 2}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0282-111de4af9a55:d02", "card_id": "ramdocs-0282-111de4af9a55:d02:c0", "entity": "Richard Sheppard", "scope": "profession", "claim": "Richard Sheppard's profession is a professional basketball player.", "answer": "professional basketball player", "quote": "the table of contents Dick Sheppard ( professional basketball player ) Add languag